{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an expansion that changes the atmosphere of the game, bringing a completely different visual experience to your journey, while not being essential and not affecting your original gameplay experience.<br>Once enabled, the entire game will present a nostalgic style reminiscent of the early 3D console era:<br>low-polygon models, pixel-textured surfaces, and retro colors and lighting,<br>making you feel as if you\u2019ve returned to the golden age of gaming.<br>This is a completely different adventure experience, and our small tribute to the era of classic games.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Note</strong>: Due to game engine characteristics, the UI and item inspection screens will retain their original appearance, while the rest will display the retro effect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3945530?t=1761033960","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945530/94d3eeb4f5e3333ab1c49f56a95adcd441450fad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761033960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945530/47da934fa73ab80ebb23860baacf186bb4d73c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761033960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945530/47da934fa73ab80ebb23860baacf186bb4d73c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761033960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains intense psycho